  "body": "***With the owners now relocated to Australia, this impressive Long Bay residence is vacant and must be sold. This creates an excellent opportunity for buyers to secure a quality architecturally designed home in sought-after Keel Street, close to the village, beach and reserve.***\r\n\r\nFinished to a superb standard, with generous proportions, thoughtful design and quality throughout, this is executive family living at its best - ready and waiting for its next owners.\r\n\r\nSoaring ceilings and double-height windows fill the home with natural light, creating an immediate sense of space and openness. Spread over two levels, the thoughtfully designed layout offers five double bedrooms and multiple living areas, giving families plenty of room and flexibility. \r\n\r\nThe ground-floor bedroom has its own entrance, bathroom and lounge, making it ideal for guests, teenagers or extended family. Upstairs, four further bedrooms are complemented by a family lounge, with two bedrooms enjoying their own ensuites and walk-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nThe main living area flows effortlessly to beautifully landscaped outdoor spaces, where Kwila decking and an Archgola create a wonderful setting for entertaining or simply relaxing at home. The designer kitchen combines style and practicality, featuring quality appliances, engineered stone benchtops and a generous butler's pantry complete with an additional gas cooking hob - ideal for those who love to cook and entertain.\r\n\r\nComfort and convenience are well covered, with central air-conditioning, underfloor heating, electric blinds, security cameras, built-in speakers, excellent storage and a large internal-access double garage.\r\n\r\nBeyond the home, Keel Street offers a wonderful sense of community, with the beach, reserve, village amenities and excellent schooling all close by. It's a location where families can enjoy the best of Long Bay, from coastal walks and beach days to cafés and local conveniences.",
